    consents: [
      consent('tox', 'Neurotoxin Consent', 'Botulinum toxin (Botox, Dysport, Xeomin) temporarily relaxes targeted muscles to soften expression lines. Results appear in 3–14 days and last 3–4 months. Common effects: bruising, swelling, headache. Uncommon: asymmetry, eyelid or brow droop, which resolve as the product wears off. Not for pregnancy, nursing, or neuromuscular disorders. Treatment is performed under the supervision of our medical director.', ['I am not pregnant, nursing, or diagnosed with a neuromuscular disorder, and I have disclosed all medications and supplements.', 'I understand results vary and that a droop, if it occurs, is temporary.', 'I will stay upright for 4 hours and avoid rubbing the area, exercise and alcohol for 24 hours.']),
      consent('filler', 'Dermal Filler Consent', 'Hyaluronic acid fillers add volume and structure. Expect swelling and possible bruising for up to 2 weeks. Rare but serious risks include infection, nodules, and vascular occlusion, which can cause tissue damage or vision loss if untreated. Report pain, blanching, dusky skin or vision changes immediately. Cold sores can be triggered by lip filler.', ['I understand the signs of vascular occlusion and have the after-hours number to report them immediately.', 'I have disclosed previous fillers, permanent implants, cold-sore history and blood thinners.', 'I will avoid pressure, dental work, heat and strenuous exercise for 48 hours.']),
      consent('laser', 'Laser & Light Consent', 'Laser and IPL treatments use light energy absorbed by hair pigment, blood vessels or skin pigment. Tanned or recently sun-exposed skin, certain medications and some skin types increase the risk of burns, blistering and pigment changes. Eye protection is mandatory. Results require a series.', ['I have not tanned, used self-tanner, or had unprotected sun exposure in the last 2 weeks, and will not for 2 weeks after.', 'I have disclosed Accutane use in the last 6 months, photosensitizing medications, and my skin\'s tanning response.', 'I will wear SPF daily and report blistering or pigment changes.']),
      consent('body', 'Body Contouring Consent', 'Non-invasive contouring reduces fat cells by cooling or tones muscle with electromagnetic energy. Expect numbness, tingling, redness and tenderness for days to weeks. Rare: paradoxical fat growth, late-onset pain. Not for pregnancy, hernias at the site, cold-related conditions, or metal implants near the area.', ['I am not pregnant and have no hernia, metal implant or cold-related condition at the treatment site.', 'I understand results take 8–12 weeks and may require more than one session.']),
    ],
